200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=90f7c4b29c0054c5728698fb3cd880f3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@apjjsfmd/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/83b84cee/uploads/origins/6af33545-9085-4389-aeaf-555c589453e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cdb67042e47627c9810b5e8a9f3b65f2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/83b84cee/uploads/origins/6af33545-9085-4389-aeaf-555c589453e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cdb67042e47627c9810b5e8a9f3b65f2, https://si.imgix.net/83b84cee/uploads/origins/6af33545-9085-4389-aeaf-555c589453e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3fcb4b85e28cbd887be867e648d28fb9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/83b84cee/uploads/origins/6af33545-9085-4389-aeaf-555c589453e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ea51c5c311f3f4f016a8a19afc4a44d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "リクエストお願いいたします\n\n【モデル】 \n恋星はるか(GILTY×GILTY)\n\n【構図】\n 頭のてっぺんから膝上まで(可能なら全身)\n \n【要望】\nGILTY MVの雰囲気 白衣装\n\nよろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@apjjsfmd/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/84ad170e/uploads/origins/7bc37d24-021b-43c2-8437-7e786af67f78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c4bced055d49412da1f45fd6e4d0325", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/84ad170e/uploads/origins/7bc37d24-021b-43c2-8437-7e786af67f78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c4bced055d49412da1f45fd6e4d0325, https://si.imgix.net/84ad170e/uploads/origins/7bc37d24-021b-43c2-8437-7e786af67f78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=12a80b628f96373539a8e6b8344cbe63 2x, https://si.imgix.net/84ad170e/uploads/origins/7bc37d24-021b-43c2-8437-7e786af67f78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bcbdb1dbbbb17ac512834f6eb3282655 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "リクエストお願いします！\n\nアイドルグループ、GILTY×GILTYの擬人化キャラクター、ギルギルちゃんのイラストをお願いします。\n参考資料フォルダ内にSDキャラの画像がございます。\n単体でのイラストと全身のイラストが見つからなかったのですが、使用用途はSNSアカウントのアイコンなので顔をメインにアップで描いていただきたいです。\n画像形式はいつも通りPNG希望です。\n\nご検討よろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10h05W8JSFSrMy07N2CaXEsnKIxEPQ1ah", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@apjjsfmd/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1a7b6ca8/uploads/origins/c774cc24-bf5d-4768-9baa-60a5ec18c31a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=251b7e8e5bfa6b397ea3f137ef176a05", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1a7b6ca8/uploads/origins/c774cc24-bf5d-4768-9baa-60a5ec18c31a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=251b7e8e5bfa6b397ea3f137ef176a05, https://si.imgix.net/1a7b6ca8/uploads/origins/c774cc24-bf5d-4768-9baa-60a5ec18c31a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=519e1d8ad628a20636044a0e5869a5bc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1a7b6ca8/uploads/origins/c774cc24-bf5d-4768-9baa-60a5ec18c31a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=656aec6887fe0ba1081e146125a4b19a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "キャラクターデザインのリクエストをさせてください\n\n【名前】\n架空おとぎ\n\n【設定】\n創作者\n\n【詳細】\n髪型：ロング\n髪色：烏の濡れ羽色\nインナーカラー：白\n服装：ゴシックロリータ\n雰囲気：浮世離れ\n\n【アイテム】\n・丸眼鏡\n・羊皮紙\n・羽根ペン\n・黒インク\n・リボン\n・髪飾り\n\n\n【架空の意味】\n根拠のないこと。また、事実に基づかず、想像によってつくりあげること。また、そのさま。\n\n【おとぎの意味】\n御伽話しの略。御伽話しの意味：現実離れした空想的な話。\n\n\n検討よろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@apjjsfmd/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2afac8e0/uploads/origins/7806ec49-bc73-466e-b624-acf7225d226a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4849c8e0dc918280fa2cd8fd34037d5c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2afac8e0/uploads/origins/7806ec49-bc73-466e-b624-acf7225d226a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4849c8e0dc918280fa2cd8fd34037d5c, https://si.imgix.net/2afac8e0/uploads/origins/7806ec49-bc73-466e-b624-acf7225d226a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5e7ede62bd80961ad532bafd5b3bc781 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2afac8e0/uploads/origins/7806ec49-bc73-466e-b624-acf7225d226a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c88485ec0547f541edd5445872c864bd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "リクエストお願いいたします\n\n【モデル】\n白空こあい(GILTY×GILTY)\n\n【構図】\n顔アップ(SNSアイコンに設定したときに映える構図)\n\n【要望】\nGILTY MVの雰囲気\n白衣装\n\nよろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@apjjsfmd/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/204cb107/uploads/origins/eb9802ab-7243-4b73-bbd7-0c40e908284b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2c2a2f249bee430df379b536b0c5609", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/204cb107/uploads/origins/eb9802ab-7243-4b73-bbd7-0c40e908284b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2c2a2f249bee430df379b536b0c5609, https://si.imgix.net/204cb107/uploads/origins/eb9802ab-7243-4b73-bbd7-0c40e908284b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ad831d3b4906e89fc98cc06961773c2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/204cb107/uploads/origins/eb9802ab-7243-4b73-bbd7-0c40e908284b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5abcf8716560782e9f58a1d73a7a9223 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I would like to make a request involving two characters. These original characters are meant to be dolls that were created by Alice to represent Tweedle dee and Tweedle dum from the Alice in wonderland series. They are twins that wear similar outfits but the outfits are different in color. Both of them show little to no emotion and their facial expression usually remains the same. Both characters are meant to be dolls so please draw them with doll like limbs and joints.  The references are attached below, I leave their poses to your creativity and I look forward to your work.\n\nhttps://imgchest.com/p/9249g6oo27n", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@apjjsfmd/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/93b671d3/uploads/origins/c9219d09-8977-43c8-a459-f7f92644c906?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=79577fe326030faaf4658fad7de57699", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/93b671d3/uploads/origins/c9219d09-8977-43c8-a459-f7f92644c906?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=79577fe326030faaf4658fad7de57699, https://si.imgix.net/93b671d3/uploads/origins/c9219d09-8977-43c8-a459-f7f92644c906?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56c3e386baf9d7996976d7742b98b5b2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/93b671d3/uploads/origins/c9219d09-8977-43c8-a459-f7f92644c906?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e5ca03c1f33232c905240cea9c868b5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I love your art! Please draw my vtuber in your style! I will use this for social media and streaming purposes. Thank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1SYLyXKk3couqAbs-2f2CnqhanXhdszaz/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@apjjsfmd/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5ad03ad0/uploads/origins/75e077f6-bcc2-4725-b50f-6a46f85ce9ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f3a3c85e18944b06b5f3e8efcc7c2313", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5ad03ad0/uploads/origins/75e077f6-bcc2-4725-b50f-6a46f85ce9ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f3a3c85e18944b06b5f3e8efcc7c2313, https://si.imgix.net/5ad03ad0/uploads/origins/75e077f6-bcc2-4725-b50f-6a46f85ce9ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b1cf62095fe8e3fe487f4550ac5d572e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5ad03ad0/uploads/origins/75e077f6-bcc2-4725-b50f-6a46f85ce9ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61071d899a956e045b465ed8f0218a46 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "リクエストお願いします。\n\n【内容】\n棺桶ひつぎの顔アップのイラスト\n\n【補足】\nSNSアイコンへ使用したいです\nフードを被っている・被ってない2種希望\n納品時の形式はPNG\n\nよろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@apjjsfmd/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f88fd50e/uploads/origins/870461ea-47b8-4cb9-aa56-5e6890266b81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0d90c999cf9ee1fa0fc183c1ecbb796", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f88fd50e/uploads/origins/870461ea-47b8-4cb9-aa56-5e6890266b81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0d90c999cf9ee1fa0fc183c1ecbb796, https://si.imgix.net/f88fd50e/uploads/origins/870461ea-47b8-4cb9-aa56-5e6890266b81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f44d414e692e15a9fb533c175c6a7992 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f88fd50e/uploads/origins/870461ea-47b8-4cb9-aa56-5e6890266b81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04a92f4188191fb1812b780aa6ee5758 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Dear 🔪, nice to meet you.\n\nI saw your illustration and fell in love at first sight with your cute, yet somehow disturbing and captivating style. I would love to have you draw an illustration of Rei Kuroma (@kuromareiriam), who is a V-lover.\n\nWhat do you want to use the illustration for?\nAs a gift to the person in question and for personal viewing\nThe illustration may be used only by the person himself/herself for distribution activities (in distribution, as a thumbnail of distribution, as a return gift to listeners, on X (formerly Twitter), etc.).\n*Rei Kuroma has permission to make requests on Skeb and other sites.\n\n ◯Reference materials\n Please refer to the URL page of the reference materials for standing drawings and other materials.\n\nSituations, etc.\nI like your sense of style, so I would be happy if you could draw in your own way in your area of expertise without losing the style of your drawing.\n\nFormat\nPSD or PNG data is preferred.\nWe would like to receive data with the illustration and background layered.\n\nOther\nWe would appreciate it if you could make it so that the ears and hair are not visible so that we can easily use them as thumbnails, etc.\nWe would be happy if you have a background as well. (It is okay if you don't have any background.)\nIf there are any missing amounts, please send us a resend request.\n\n(As a side note, I like the following illustrations by 🔪 very much...!)\n\n\nhttps://x.com/apjjsfmd/status/1855472348641821120?s=46&t=7hNaxooGP7xkeuikF_oT3g\n\nhttps://x.com/apjjsfmd/status/1592858932070223875?s=46&t=7hNaxooGP7xkeuikF_oT3g\n\n\nWe sincerely appreciate your consideration of this matter.\nWe sincerely support 🔪s activities in the future.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1--Nukg4A_SLDP0LjT-1pz4lFRpdLVSZ2", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@apjjsfmd/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7117766d/uploads/origins/67aa5d35-0c45-4483-9c27-a14291309f25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d79f4bdaecefa9e7d5dc6fa703e37210", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7117766d/uploads/origins/67aa5d35-0c45-4483-9c27-a14291309f25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d79f4bdaecefa9e7d5dc6fa703e37210, https://si.imgix.net/7117766d/uploads/origins/67aa5d35-0c45-4483-9c27-a14291309f25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a0c5e6afc477ebab84eafd280316d9d8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7117766d/uploads/origins/67aa5d35-0c45-4483-9c27-a14291309f25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=419252152d4f73f76d58938156b31da6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Please make a request!\n\nI would like to request a character design based on the following settings.\n\n[Name\nCoffin Hitsugi\n\nSetting\nAn undead girl.\nShe carries a western coffin larger than her own height.\nThe coffin also serves as her bed and toolbox, and she keeps candles, knives, and other things she needs for her journey inside.\nShe is a traveler in the dark who travels through the night with a coffin on her back.\n\nPhysique\nsmall build\n\nCoffin\nBigger than his own height.\nBlack base color, white pattern and pattern\n\nHair\nSilver hair (shoulder-length)\n\nSkin\nFair skin\n\nCostume\nBlack robe with hood\nWhite lining\n\nOther\nBasically hooded\nMoe sleeves\nA large robe wraps his petite frame.\n\nExpressionless\nExpressionless\nEmotionless\nLacks emotion\n\n\nBest regards", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@apjjsfmd/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/84afb428/uploads/origins/288c4ac5-3623-4798-8737-588b41da7f52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bb95673ce77f422ca5bc309237b07602", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/84afb428/uploads/origins/288c4ac5-3623-4798-8737-588b41da7f52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bb95673ce77f422ca5bc309237b07602, https://si.imgix.net/84afb428/uploads/origins/288c4ac5-3623-4798-8737-588b41da7f52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f9d2796ef9c86a218556cb09e88509f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/84afb428/uploads/origins/288c4ac5-3623-4798-8737-588b41da7f52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8f081eba3eae80f527b0c7d34b7a14bf 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thank you for the great character design last time!\nIt is the best!\n\nPlease send us a new request.\n\n[theme\nCharacter coloring change\n\nThere ar